# Xavfsizlik sarlavhalari — Cloudflare Pages buni avtomatik o'qiydi
# (10-topshiriq, C qism; VM 373-son qarori bilan bog'liq emas, umumiy amaliyot).
#
# CSP hozircha FAQAT Report-Only rejimida. Bir necha kun brauzer konsolida
# qanday buzilish (violation) chiqishini kuzating, keyin
# `Content-Security-Policy-Report-Only` ni `Content-Security-Policy` ga
# almashtiring. Xato sozlangan CSP butun saytni ishlatmay qo'yishi mumkin —
# shoshilmang.

/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()
  Content-Security-Policy-Report-Only: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self'; style-src 'self' https://fonts.googleapis.com; font-src 'self' https://fonts.gstatic.com; img-src 'self' data:; connect-src 'self' https://energetika-api.saidmurodjon1020.workers.dev; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'
